Patient Zero is a non-commercial fan adaptation. Game mechanics are inspired by
Secret Hitler, created by Mike Boxleiter, Tommy Maranges, and Mac Schubert,
licensed under CC BY-NC-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/4.0/).
Secret Hitler: https://www.secrethitler.com/

This adaptation changes the theme, names, and rules wording (Humans / Infected /
Patient Zero, Squad Leader / Medic, Cure / Outbreak, and related terms) and adds
online and pass-and-play software. It does not use Secret Hitler art, card text,
or original rules wording.

You are free to share and adapt this work under the same CC BY-NC-SA 4.0 terms:
attribution, non-commercial use only, and share-alike. This work must not be
sold, used for advertising, or submitted to an app store.

Full license text: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/4.0/legalcode
